[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 841.509, "timestamp": "00:14:01", "text": "信息。此外，他的麦克风也处于这种状态。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 843.271, "timestamp": "00:14:03", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Daamn"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 844.59, "timestamp": "00:14:04", "text": "静音。你看，你也看到了这个图标。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 848.629, "timestamp": "00:14:08", "text": "正确的？我希望你能做到。对，就是这样。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 848.792, "timestamp": "00:14:08", "author": "@astravt", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/MdOwC7qdh0gmlabcCYgLQ5BOZxo7CGLbc14xFv1rO9eQ745gkga99YKsszwMjcyNnEBittX8WA=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "That is actually cool"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 850.59, "timestamp": "00:14:10", "text": "所以，我们就这么做了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 853.11, "timestamp": "00:14:13", "text": "今天。呃，我有一个用来睡觉的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 854.79, "timestamp": "00:14:14", "text": "午睡、上厕所、个人时间"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 857.59, "timestamp": "00:14:17", "text": "音乐、学习、我的休息时间。我想制作"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 859.47, "timestamp": "00:14:19", "text": "这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 862.069, "timestamp": "00:14:22", "text": "自动化。所以，我不需要“不”，我想要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 864.629, "timestamp": "00:14:24", "text": "为了实现这一点，我把它应用到了 Discord 上。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 868.43, "timestamp": "00:14:28", "text": "出色地。在 Discord 上以客户 PC 的身份发言"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 871.79, "timestamp": "00:14:31", "text": "那个东西表明我是呃"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 874.15, "timestamp": "00:14:34", "text": "流式多路复用到多个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 878.949, "timestamp": "00:14:38", "text": "平台等等。另外，嗯，如果我在"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 881.11, "timestamp": "00:14:41", "text": "如果我休息的时候会直播等等。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 884.23, "timestamp": "00:14:44", "text": "这也表明我不知道我为什么需要"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 886.629, "timestamp": "00:14:46", "text": "它。我当时就想，这挺酷的。为什么"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 890.43, "timestamp": "00:14:50", "text": "难道我不是那样做的吗？所以我想到了这样做"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 894.629, "timestamp": "00:14:54", "text": "它。其实没必要。我当时"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 897.829, "timestamp": "00:14:57", "text": "我很久以前就想这么做了。我使用"}]